<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>System Mainframe | Nidal Navas</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #05070a;
            --terminal-bg: #0a0f1d;
            --text-color: #00ff66;
            --text-dim: #00aa44;
            --accent-glow: #00ff66;
            --border-color: #00ff66;
        }
        body {
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        .terminal {
            background-color: var(--terminal-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.15);
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 650px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .terminal-header {
            background-color: #111827;
            padding: 10px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #1f2937;
        }
        .dot {
            width: 12px;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 50%;
        }
        .dot-red { background-color: #ef4444; }
        .dot-yellow { background-color: #f59e0b; }
        .dot-green { background-color: #10b981; }
        
        .content {
            padding: 30px 20px;
        }
        .profile-section {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--text-dim);
            padding-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .avatar {
            width: 110px;
            height: 110px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.3);
            object-fit: cover;
            background-color: #111;
        }
        .profile-text h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 5px var(--accent-glow);
        }
        .status {
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin: 5px 0 0 0;
        }
        .console-line {
            margin: 12px 0;
            line-height: 1.5;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
        .prompt { color: #ffffff; }
        .output { color: #c9d1d9; font-size: 0.9rem; padding-left: 15px; }
        
        .links {
            margin-top: 30px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .btn {
            background: transparent;
            color: var(--text-color);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--text-color);
            color: var(--bg-color);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--accent-glow);
        }
        @keyframes blink {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="terminal">
        <div class="terminal-header">
            <div class="dot dot-red"></div>
            <div class="dot dot-yellow"></div>
            <div class="dot dot-green"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            
            <div class="profile-section">
                <img src="./profile.jpg" alt="Nidal Navas" class="avatar">
                <div class="profile-text">
                    <h1>SYS.LOC://NIDAL_NAVAS</h1>
                    <p class="status">SYSTEM STATUS: ACTIVE<span style="animation: blink 1s infinite;">_</span></p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="console-line">
                <span class="prompt">root@mainframe:~#</span> ./view_identity.sh
                <div class="output">Identity verified. Core focus: Python Programming, Artificial Intelligence Engineering, and Cyber Security Protocols. Developer of custom automation scripts and desktop interface frameworks.</div>
            </div>

            <div class="console-line">
                <span class="prompt">root@mainframe:~#</span> ./list_active_projects.sh
                <div class="output">
                    > [PROJECT_01]: "Jarvis" - Core AI Voice Assistant Control Center<br>
                    > [PROJECT_02]: Advanced Computer Vision Systems (OpenCV & MediaPipe Nodes)
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="console-line">
                <span class="prompt">root@mainframe:~#</span> <span style="animation: blink 1s infinite; color: var(--text-color);">█</span>
            </div>

            <div class="links">
                <a href="https://github.com/nidalnavas981-sys" target="_blank" class="btn">[ GITHUB ]</a>
                <a href="https://instagram.com/" target="_blank" class="btn">[ INSTAGRAM ]</a>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
